      "en": "Spanish state shipbuilder Navantia presented its SMART 4000 frigate concept at Euronaval 2026, a 4,000-tonne multi-role surface combatant engineered from inception as a mothership for unmanned multi-domain swarms. Featuring a stealth faceted superstructure, hybrid-electric propulsion for silent littoral cruising, and modular mission bays with automated launch-and-recovery systems, the vessel integrates an open-architecture C4IP combat system requiring a substantially reduced crew complement.",
